@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### List books
GET {{host}}/books

### Create a book
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9780596007126",
  "title": "Head First Design Patterns",
  "author": "Eric Freeman, Elisabeth Robson",
  "genre": "Programming",
  "price": 44.00,
  "stockQuantity": 8
}

### Place an order (replace the bookId with one from GET /books)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "reader@example.com",
  "lines": [
    { "bookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}
